{"unit_id":"cnkids__dsh-office-toolkit#card-zh","repo":"cnkids/dsh-office-toolkit","commit":"cc8b8d329a69aae9c29541a72e165b76054e60d8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Office Toolkit 为 DSH 智能体提供读取和编辑 Word、PDF 与 Excel 等文档表格的工具。它通过 DSH 的 tools 服务注册文件操作能力，可读取多种常见文档格式、分段读取长文、查看 DOCX 排版，并在表格文件中筛选、分组、汇总、连接和透视数据。用户也可创建或修改 DOCX 与 XLSX、按模板填充合同，并在同一家族格式间转换文件。适合需要让智能体直接处理办公文件的场景；安装插件即可使用，PDF 输出等转换需本机有 LibreOffice 或 Microsoft Word。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:319-335","lib/core/office.js:176-221"]}
{"unit_id":"cnkids__dsh-office-toolkit#card-en","repo":"cnkids/dsh-office-toolkit","commit":"cc8b8d329a69aae9c29541a72e165b76054e60d8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Office Toolkit gives DSH agents tools to read Word, PDF and spreadsheet files, query tables, create or edit DOCX and XLSX documents, fill Word templates, and convert related formats. Long files can be read in chunks. Some conversions require LibreOffice or Microsoft Word.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:319-335","lib/core/office.js:176-221"]}
